		<headline><![CDATA[]]></headline>
		<summary><![CDATA[RoaR.GG is a PC Gaming Community founded December, 2011. We believe games are more enjoyable in a organized environment but without all of the bull**** that's included in most gaming communities. RoaR.GG was initially founded as a Mount &amp; Blade: Warband group but in 2017 we decided to make a big change and rebrand to an esports community. Due to the hard work and ambition of our staff and members through the transition we've been successful in growing our brand, providing teams, servers and events for our newly founded esports community. To many of us RoaR.GG is much more than a gaming community, it's a family. Looking to join? Add <a class="bb_link" href="http://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044997257/" target="_blank" rel="" >River</a>, <a class="bb_link" href="http://steamcommunity.com/id/kavcav/" target="_blank" rel="" >Kavcav</a> or <a class="bb_link" href="http://steamcommunity.com/id/oost1296/" target="_blank" rel="" >Maximus</a> on steam.<br><br><a class="bb_link" href="https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=http%3A%2F%2Froaresports.com" target="_blank" rel=" noopener" >http://roaresports.com</a><br><br>]]></summary>
